# Web and Electron

QuizApp is one React UI with two builds. Follow `AGENTS.md`.

- Electron: `npm run dev`, `npm run build:mac`. Data goes through `window.quizApi`.
- Web: `npm run dev -- --web`, `npm run build:web`. Data goes through `src/lib/browserQuizApi.ts` (IndexedDB). Theme and setup choices stay in `localStorage` on both.
- `src/api/quizApi.ts` picks the store. Screens in `src/` stay shared. Gate desktop-only UI with `isElectronApp()`.
- A new quiz, folder, or attempt field must be saved and read in both stores.
- Desktop only: mobile mode, updates, Mac window chrome, the app-menu data wipe, and Electron print-to-PDF. The web print path still uses `src/lib/printQuiz.ts`.
